# LaTeX gitignore for the seminarski (XeLaTeX + latexmk).
# Track only sources: .tex, .sty, .latexmkrc, images. Everything below is regenerated
# by compiling OzicaneNeuronskeMreze.tex.

## Build output folder (.latexmkrc sends aux and PDF files here)
build/

## Compiled paper when the editor runs xelatex directly (skips .latexmkrc and writes
## next to the .tex). Only PDFs directly in latex/ — figure PDFs in subfolders stay tracked.
/*.pdf

## Broken LaTeX Workshop out-dir setting creates a folder literally named %OUTDIR%
%OUTDIR%/

## Core auxiliary files (if something is compiled outside build/)
*.aux
*.lof
*.log
*.lot
*.fls
*.out
*.toc
*.fmt
*.fot
*.cb
*.cb2
.*.lb

## Intermediate documents (XeLaTeX writes .xdv before the PDF)
*.dvi
*.xdv
*-converted-to.*

## Bibliography (in case biblatex/BibTeX replaces thebibliography later)
*.bbl
*.bbl-SAVE-ERROR
*.bcf
*.blg
*-blx.aux
*-blx.bib
*.run.xml

## latexmk and SyncTeX (editor <-> PDF jumping)
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex
*.synctex(busy)
*.synctex.gz
*.synctex.gz(busy)
*.pdfsync

## Index, listings, nomenclature
*.idx
*.ilg
*.ind
*.lol
*.nlo
*.nls

## TikZ externalization
*.auxlock
*.dpth
*.md5
*-figure*.pdf
*-figure*.log

## minted (syntax highlighting via Pygments)
_minted*/
*.pyg

## Editor backups and temp files
*.bak
*.sav
*.swp
*~
*.tps

## OS files
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
